OL,5,G2215 70 Up
OL,6,     FOscar-winning film-maker Asif
OL,7,     FKapadia takes over from the
OL,8,     Foriginal director Michael Apted
OL,9,     Ffor the first of a two-part final
OL,10,     Finstalment of the documentary
OL,11,     Ffirst broadcast in 1964 that
OL,12,     Frevisits subjects every seven
OL,13,     Fyears. Having first featured on
OL,14,     Fthe programme as seven-year-olds,
OL,15,     Fthey reflect on their lives having
OL,16,     Fnow reached the age of 70, while
OL,17,     Fthe programme asks what the series
OL,18,     Fhas revealed about British society
